supporter: To create a program in p5.js with a knob that changes the number of sides of a shape, you'll require p5.js and p5.dom.js libraries as they are necessary for creating the slider (knob) in this example.

First, create an HTML file named `index.html` and include the p5.js and p5.dom.js libraries inside it:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Shape with Sides</title>
